risk cue </span><math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{c}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (tie-rate, Eq. </span><a href="#S3.E5" title="In 3.3. Coordination risk cue ‣ 3. Preference-Derived Collaboration Signals ‣ Task-Aware Delegation Cues for LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a><span id="alg1.l1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">); threshold </span><math id="alg1.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
