            <span id="alg2.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Step 2: Preference-derived signals (Sec. <a href="#S3.SS2" title="3.2. Capability profile ‣ 3. Preference-Derived Collaboration Signals ‣ Task-Aware Delegation Cues for LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a>–<a href="#S3.SS3" title="3.3. Coordination risk cue ‣ 3. Preference-Derived Collaboration Signals ‣ Task-Aware Delegation Cues for LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3</span></a>)</span><span id="alg2.l10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
