<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span> Task typing and preference signal computation</figcaption>
<div id="alg3.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
